		{"id":"a3dfa4c3b26a9c79","type":"text","text":"H264 bitPerSecond 是否过高\nvideo cache 是否太小\n网络发送是否频繁 drop\nKCP/UDP 是否拥塞","x":-4334,"y":4560,"width":382,"height":153},
		{"id":"d4c4f93ddd0a7877","type":"text","text":"videoPath 是否包含 KSHM\nVIDEO_KSHM_ACCESS 是否成功\nvideo_data_thread 是否启动\nHDMI_RX_START 是否成功","x":-4143,"y":4283,"width":509,"height":143},
